      "created_at": "2015-02-22T21:19:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Note that you can completely evade Apostate's flip mechanic if you have any kind of insta-kill effect (Sucker Punch, Wrathful Gaze, Cornered Beast, etc) as his flip mechanic only engages if his hp is reduced to zero or fewer and these aren't reducing his hp but just destroying him outright. I think there's someone else this works with but I can't remember who it is off the top of my head. Doesn't work on Blade though, since his flip mechanic kicks in when he \"would be destroyed\" :P.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Destruction kills Wager Master if \"Who are you fighting?!\" is out and gets around the \"If Wager Master's HP is reduced to 0 or fewer the heroes lose.\" condition.</p>",
